    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bantu ba mu buloba bakangata Yehoaza, muana wa Yoshiya, bakamuhingisha mu bukelenge mu muaba wa tatuʼandi mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoaza wakadi ne bidimu makumi abidi ne bisatu hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema ngondo isatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wa Ejipitu wakamûmusha mu bukelenge mu Yelushalema, wakafutshisha bena buloba ntalanta",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.3:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 2 Kulondolola 3.9; 25.6.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya argent lukama ne wa or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.3:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tangila 2 Kulondolola 3.8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wa Ejipitu wakahingisha muanʼabo Eleyakima mu bukelenge bua Yuda ne Yelushalema; wakamuidika dina ne Yehoyakima. Neko wakakuata Yehoaza muanʼabo, wakaya nʼandi mu Ejipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakima wakadi ne bidimu makumi abidi ne bitanu hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu dikumi ne tshimue; wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa Nzambi wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadenesâ, mukelenge wa Babulona, wakalua bua kuluangana nʼandi, wakamusuika nkanu bua kuya nʼandi ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadenesâ wakaya kabidi ne mpanza mikuabo yakadi mu nsubu wa Yehowa, wakayiteka mu ntempelo wandi wa mu Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bikuabo bia Yehoyakima ne malu a bundu akenzeye ne akadi munda muandi bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa bakelenge ba Isalele ne ba Yuda; Yehoyakina muanʼandi wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakina wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne muanda mukulu hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema ngondo isatu ne matuku dikumi; Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabanga tshidimu tshikuabo, mukelenge Nebuka-denesâ wakatuma bantu, bakaya nʼandi ku Babulona ne bintu bia mushinga mukole biakadi mu nsubu wa Yehowa; bakahingisha Sedekiya muanʼabo mu bukelenge bua Yuda ne Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya wakadi ne bidimu makumi abidi ne tshimue hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu dikumi ne tshimue; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa Nzambi wandi; kakadihuekesha ku mesu kua Yelemiya muprofete hakamuambileye mei a kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye kabidi wakatombokela mukelenge Nebukadenesâ, nguakamutshihisha kudi Nzambi; kadi yeye wakadi ne mampaka, wakakolesha mutshima wandi kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bukuabo kabidi, bakuidi banene bonso ne bantu bakananukila kulonda malu onso a bundu a bantu ba bisamba bikuabo bakanyanga nsubu wa Yehowa wakajidileye mu Yelushalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wa bankambua babo, wakananukila kubatumina bambi bandi; bualu bua wakadi ne bantu bandi ne muaba wandi luse; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi bobo bakaseka bambi ba Nzambi; bakahetula mei andi, bakahenda baprofete bandi tô ne hakamueneka tshiji tshia Yehowa kudi bantu bandi tshidi katshiyi tshishika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakatuma mukelenge wa Bena Kasada bua kuluanganeye nʼabo, bakashiha bansongalume babo ne muele wa nvita mu muaba wabo wa tshijila; kabakafuila bansongalume ne bansongakashi bakatshidi kamama nansha bantu banunu bakoke luse; wakabafila bonso mu bianza biandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaya ne mpanza yonso yakadi mu nsubu wa Nzambi, ne minene ne mikese ne bintu biakadi mu bibutshilu bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa ne bia mukelenge ne bia baminyampala bandi, bakaya nʼabi bionso ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakosha nsubu wa Nzambi ne kahia, bakashimbula ngumbu ya Yelushalema, bakosha mbalasa yau yonso ne kahia, bakahaula bintu bionso bia mushinga mukole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaya ne bantu bakahanduka ku muele wa nvita ku Babulona; bakadi bahika ba mukelenge ne ba bana bandi tô ne hakalua bukelenge bua Pelasa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua kujadika dî dia Yehowa mukana mua Yelemiya, bua buloba busanke mu matuku abu a lumingu; bualu bua hakadibu bubutula, bakavuluka matuku a lumingu tô ne hakakumbana bidimu makumi muanda mutekete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia kumudilu tshia Kolesha, mukelenge wa Pelasa, bua kujadika di dia Yehowa diakambeye mukana mua Yelemiya, Yehowa wakasonsola mutshima wa Kolesha, mukelenge wa Pelasa, bua kueleye mukenji mu bukelenge buandi buonso, wakafunda nunku ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolesha, mukelenge wa Pelasa, udi wamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa mu diulu, wakumpa makelenge onso a ha buloba; wakungelela mukenji bua kumuashila nsubu mu Yelushalema udi mu Yuda. Muntu yonso wa bantu bandi bonso badi munkatshi muenu aye biandi, ne Yehowa Nzambi wandi ikale nʼandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
